#. <CLT 23>「キーン、コーン…　カーン、コーン」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, bing bong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. えー、校内放送でーす。
msgctxt "0002 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Umm, this is a school announcement..."
msgstr ""

#. オマエラ、頑張ってる？
#. 捜査は順調に進んでるかなー！？
msgctxt "0003 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Is everyone working hard? Is your investigation coming\n"
"along nicely?"
msgstr ""

#. あのね。頑張るオマエラに、
#. 優しいボクからヒントがあるんだよ！
msgctxt "0004 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Well then. Since you're all giving it your best, your\n"
"generous headmaster will give you a little hint!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…ヒントが欲しい人は、
#. 急いで体育館まで来てくださーい！！
msgctxt "0005 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu... For those of you who are interested, please\n"
"make your way to the gym ASAPossible!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>な、なんだよ…いきなりヒントって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What...? *Now* he wants to give us a hint?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 明らかに怪しい…罠かもしれない…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It's suspicious, there's no doubt about that... This\n"
"could be a trap..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうは、わかっているけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But even knowing that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>確か…体育館に来いって言ってたよな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He said to go to the gym, right...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
